# Welcome to Radii Office

Radii Office is a #G#free#, #B#open-source# suite of apps that runs in your browser, works offline and also comes as desktop apps. There is nothing to sign up for to write, draw, plan or calculate, and your files stay on your computer unless you choose to share them!

::tip New here?
Open [Writeout](#/writeout), type `# Hello` and press Enter. You just used Keydown, the formatting language every app shares. The [Keydown guide](#/keydown-start) explains the rest!
::end

::divider{aqua}

